{"diagnosis": "Trace shows TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 with tohost FAIL 0xdead instead of progress through 256-word NOP memory. mem_done at picorv32.v:376 requires (mem_do_rinst && mem_do_rdata || mem_do_wdata) so a fetch-only cycle with mem_do_rinst alone never asserts mem_done via the mem_xfer && |mem_state path. This holds mem_busy without mem_done and stalls instruction fetch, explaining zero progress; restoring || fixes the handshake.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -375,3 +375,3 @@
 	wire mem_busy = |{mem_do_prefetch, mem_do_rinst, mem_do_rdata, mem_do_wdata};
-	wire mem_done = resetn && ((mem_xfer && |mem_state && (mem_do_rinst && mem_do_rdata || mem_do_wdata)) || (&mem_state && mem_do_rinst)) &&
+	wire mem_done = resetn && ((mem_xfer && |mem_state && (mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata || mem_do_wdata)) || (&mem_state && mem_do_rinst)) &&
 			(!mem_la_firstword || (~&mem_rdata_latched[1:0] && mem_xfer));
", "expected": "tohost PASS replacing FAIL 0xdead, no TRAP: no progress, max_addr advances >0x00000000"}

